dwarf.panascais_caves:blacksmith.dialog.select_mode_text=Right then, what will it be? Fuse a gemstone or pry one loose?
dwarf.panascais_caves:blacksmith.dialog.explain_system=I can §lfuse a gemstone§r into a piece of equipment to grant it extra properties, or §lremove§r a gemstone again. All that for a small fee, of course.\nTo begin, simply interact with the equipment you'd like me to work on.
dwarf.panascais_caves:blacksmith.dialog.slots_full=Your equipment has no more slots for gemstones. Remove one first if you want to add another!
dwarf.panascais_caves:blacksmith.dialog.no_gemstone_applied=I can't remove a gemstone if there isn't one applied!
dwarf.panascais_caves:blacksmith.dialog.need_more_gemstones=Bah! Ye've not got enough gemstones fer that. Bring me more an' I'll be seein' to the job, lad.
dwarf.panascais_caves:blacksmith.dialog.busy=Hold on now, I'm a bit busy right now. Come back when I've finished ye job, eh?
dwarf.panascais_caves:blacksmith.dialog.add_gemstones_title=Add Gemstones
dwarf.panascais_caves:blacksmith.dialog.add_gemstones_body=Select a gemstone to add:
dwarf.panascais_caves:blacksmith.dialog.remove_gemstones_title=Remove Gemstones
dwarf.panascais_caves:blacksmith.dialog.remove_gemstones_body=Select a gemstone to remove:
dwarf.panascais_caves:blacksmith.dialog.no_refunds=[Blacksmith Dwarf] Alrighty, but §cNO REFUNDS!
dwarf.panascais_caves:dialog.button.fuse=Fuse Item
dwarf.panascais_caves:dialog.button.remove=Remove Gemstone
dwarf.panascais_caves:dialog.button.explain=Explain System
dwarf.panascais_caves:dialog.button.confirm=Confirm
dwarf.panascais_caves:dialog.button.cancel=Nevermind....
dwarf.panascais_caves:dialog.button.close=Close
dwarf.panascais_caves:unemployed.dialog.1=BURRRPP... Oops sorry (Hardy Laugh)
dwarf.panascais_caves:unemployed.dialog.2=You feel that rumblin' deep down? Feels like somethin' big down there.
dwarf.panascais_caves:unemployed.dialog.3=Bah! Back in my day, we mined with our beards! Not these fancy pickaxes!
dwarf.panascais_caves:unemployed.dialog.4=You hear that hummin'? That's the stone singin' again. Or maybe it's just my head...
dwarf.panascais_caves:unemployed.dialog.5=I had a dream of a magic tool once. It could cut through stone like butter, made the tallest trees bend at their knees... Wouldn't that be somethin'?
dwarf.panascais_caves:unemployed.dialog.6=They carved the first rune with a pickaxe made of starlight... or was it cheese? I forget.
dwarf.panascais_caves:unemployed.dialog.7=Keep seein' those blasted scribbles on the walls again... I wonder what they're for... Can you see them too? (Hardy Laugh).
dwarf.panascais_caves:unemployed.dialog.8=They keep "it" sealed for a reason, lad... hic... but no one tells ol' Stumbler nothin'!
dwarf.panascais_caves:unemployed.dialog.9=If you find a mushroom that glows and whispers your name... don't eat it. Trust me.
dwarf.panascais_caves:unemployed.dialog.10=I think that little mushroom just talked?! Oh wait, maybe not.
dwarf.panascais_caves:unemployed.dialog.11=Hic!... I challenged the blacksmith to a duel. He brought a hammer. I brought a spoon. Guess who won?
dwarf.panascais_caves:unemployed.dialog.12=I tried to mine a creeper once... Didn't end well. Still pickin' bits of it out me beard!
dwarf.panascais_caves:unemployed.dialog.13=They say there's an ore out in the mines that's as tough as nails, but light as a feather. Will even make ya float!
